<!-- Teaching layer over the approved Patterns source 4520147. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A request passes through two wrappers. One adds a credential and the other records diagnostics. Switching their order changes what the recorder can see. Review the call path and the data visible at each wrapper.</p>

<!-- @before 6. Failure Modes & Tradeoffs :: staff -->
### Check wrapper order and platform ownership

Trace the input, call to the delegate and returned result through each wrapper. For app languages, also identify who stores the preference on each supported API level. A resource wrapper and a persisted language choice solve different parts of that problem. [Android per-app language preferences](https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/resources/app-languages).
